{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1004_405bcp", "source_sha256": "6a7c41e3c8f991a2e979609e052c0d02f57437e87b5e0075f8dc9a8fd0913024", "ja": "お疲れ様、可奈。レッスンまで時間があるけど、\nもう練習してるのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，可奈。离训练还有一段时间，你已经开始练习了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "f487c8b86dd690d412848ead1e8093cdda2e1a5e21f6a53ef02aa890e281997d", "ja": "あっ、プロデューサーさん！　お疲れ様です♪\n今のは練習じゃなくて、準備運動です！", "zh": "啊，制作人先生！辛苦了♪\n刚才的不是练习，是在做热身运动呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "25242d5be428ffa95d463c3a9d58a9e7d468e3f642fbe18315a63c543c5aab60", "ja": "体を温めておくと声が出やすくなるって、\n歌織さんが教えてくれたんですけど……。", "zh": "歌织小姐教过我，先让身体热起来的话，声音会更容易发出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "bd736b22418494e2b22de9fd0f269cc1b76a60bf32f7e5d44222d6c59afd74a3", "ja": "みんなと一緒にいると楽しくて、すぐ忘れちゃうから。\n今日は早めに来て、ちゃんとできました♪", "zh": "因为和大家在一起太开心了，一下子就会忘掉嘛。\n所以今天早早就过来了，好好做完了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1008_405bcp", "source_sha256": "69d0f4b85ec7d2b6345338757a7705799de6370abf62cb0e041333efca00d5bc", "ja": "はは、そういうことか。\n公演に向けて、気合い十分みたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这么回事啊。\n看来你为了公演，干劲十足嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "7bfc3ad1ae7ed7ea519991ed0e01c6a91ca68b3311e7da7c9995fabe7095a8e2", "ja": "もちろんです！　私、Cloverのライブができるの\nとっても楽しみにしてたんですよ！　それに……", "zh": "那是当然啦！我一直都特别期待\n能举办Clover的演唱会呢！而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "bd920e30bc7c2c7d75ddc89dccc56bfda38dfacc0b2c17f7cb83531780284bfc", "ja": "私達を待っててくれた人達が、ちゃんといるんだなって\n思ったら……本当にうれしくて！", "zh": "一想到真的有人在等着我们……\n我就觉得特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1011_405bcp", "source_sha256": "8e468ba29d70b46d56c829e9e9ba68cd605dcb9b9b7bc7713790be5540a9bd6a", "ja": "ああ。Cloverはもう……\n立派なアイドルだからな。", "zh": "啊。Clover已经是……\n出色的偶像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "bbb596255b0b18b69d9cc6e6b3f3eb9dce9d910646ee1621cd301d33596d1860", "ja": "！　立派な……アイドル……！", "zh": "！出色的……偶像……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1013_405bcp", "source_sha256": "83d1560fd5d688503fe5038b31fe3da894e4d55ae2bd1bd31b7d290a06cbd0d6", "ja": "うれしい気持ちは、しっかり届けるといい。\nアイドルとして、ファンのみんなに。", "zh": "开心的时候，就要好好传达出去。\n作为偶像，向各位粉丝好好传达。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "72acc10912dab3ccc48f691e5dc1b95c14adb3e5b2e349c9be5a3ba7b4ac784b", "ja": "はい！　感謝の気持ち～、届くかな～♪\n世界中に～、届けたい～♪　えへっ♪", "zh": "是的！　感谢的心情～，能传达出去吗～♪\n想传达给全世界～♪　嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "afb6b168da52fa6fb31f19e82c5ea56ee09e52f8ce21635767dac9183e6a4c92", "ja": "そうだ！　プロデューサーさんも、\n私と一緒にストレッチしませんか？", "zh": "对了！制作人也要不要和我一起做伸展运动？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1016_405bcp", "source_sha256": "2d4f6ac5477dec82d13508226c8ebb90af56544a6cd7047cc740c58429651e03", "ja": "へっ？　いや、オレは……。", "zh": "诶？不用了，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "82f0d7c65e2046176dde2501b377af720d576aa19bce483ea7ad859d667db072", "ja": "身体がほぐれて、きっと疲れも取れますよ！\nプロデューサーさん、絶対疲れてますから。", "zh": "身体舒展开来，肯定连疲劳也会消除的！制作人先生，您肯定累了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0463_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "2d7f3333d324ddd43d2b88516e6485d04ced9fe9e683dd4683f059d92bfb8c45", "ja": "だから遠慮しないで、さあさあ、ご一緒に！\nいち、にー、さん、し～……ストレッチ～♪", "zh": "所以别客气，来来，一起做吧！\n一、二、三、四——拉伸～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
